<TXSPN>Goto<STYLE ID="1"> picked the streets where we were least likely to be seen.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="1"> walked the whole way with us, but my legs had already turned to lead.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
