{MESON "500"}
"Welcome to the Goto home! Come to think of it, <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>, this is your first time here, isn't it?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Ooh, so this is </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">'s place! Yeah, it's my first time."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Make sure you carry your shoes up with you, okay? You never know who might come by. 
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "700" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Come on in, come on in!"
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
Goto<STYLE ID="1">'s room was on the second floor, and we went up.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh, so this is </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">'s room. You keep it pretty neat."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Senpai, you two must be hungry after all that walking, right? It's a little early, but should we have dinner?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The pizza we'd had for lunch was long gone from my stomach.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Dinner sounds good too, but we walked a lot, so if I can, I'd like a bath.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"But you walked quite a bit, so maybe a bath first would be better?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="1">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">such a good junior</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Hey, hey, will it be dinner first? A bath?
{PAUSE ""}
　O・
{PAUSE ""}
r・
{PAUSE ""}
may・
{PAUSE ""}
be―"<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Okay, </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">, that's enough!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, which do you want?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"A bath first would be nice. I'm really sweaty..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Then I'll go get it ready, so please wait here!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Goto<STYLE ID="1"> said that and left the room with a light step.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="4"> is so reliable, isn't she?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s face had clouded over somewhat.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you must think it's weird after all... Me saying I don't want to go home and stuff..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm, well... But if you'll tell me tomorrow, that's fine. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> will probably be mad at me, though..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah... I'm sure I'll get chewed out too. I'm probably making them worry..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... today, I really need you to not leave my side."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"............?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Of course! That's why we came here, isn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, that's not what I mean... I want you to not go anywhere I can't see you."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "五島.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"The bath is being drawn! Please wait 30 minutes!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, uh, </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">, good work!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="1"> was holding two bottles of tea, a Super Soda Bomber, and a towel.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A towel? For wiping off sweat, maybe?</STYLE><PG>
"Sorry about that! I hadn't even served you any tea. <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>, this one's yours, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\超炭酸.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Goto<STYLE ID="1"> handed </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> the Super Soda Bomber </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="・・・">gently</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Way to go, </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">! You're so thoughtful!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">However,</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="2"> didn't shake this, did you?"</STYLE>
