{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The liquid shot out of the can and hit </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> square in the face.</STYLE><PG>
