{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> pounced on </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\倒れる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
"Gyahahaha, that tickles, <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>! Gyahahahaha!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You shook it before you came in the room! Why are you guys always wasting soda?!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Gyahahaha! That's what bugs you?! Gyahahahahahaha!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">The two of them started a wrestling match on the bed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I should take the side of </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="3">, who'd thought up the same prank.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">! What do you think you're doing to </STYLE>my cute junior<STYLE ID="4">?!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I dove onto the bed too and went to pin </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> down.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\倒れる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"S-stop it!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
