<STYLE ID="1">Together with </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="は">lay flat</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> on the floor at the head of the stairs and watched the entrance.</STYLE>
